  <p>By using the Google Maps features on this website, you agree to the <a href="https://maps.google.com/help/terms_maps/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Maps / Google Earth Additional Terms of Service (opens in a new tab)</a>, including the Google Terms of Service referenced there. Google’s handling of information is described in its <a href="https://www.google.com/policies/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy (opens in a new tab)</a>.</p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Contact <a href="mailto:17hvac@gmail.com">17hvac@gmail.com</a> about our services or this website. See our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy policy</a> for information about the enquiry form and Google Maps integration.</p>
